[hr][/hr]
[h1]v2.0.4 🐛BUGFIX PATCH UPDATE!🐛[/h1]
[hr][/hr]
[b]🛠️ HOTFIX PATCH[/b]
[i]This small patch fixes critical crashes with UI files![/i]

[b]🪲BUGFIXES[/b]
[list]
[*]🐛 Fixed a critical crash where the game server would sometimes fail to start when trying to load Starfall's UI files. The server now correctly ignores these client-side visual menus!
[/list]
